{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will meet with you there and speak with you.</b> For there the Shekhinah dwelt, and it dwells in every place where the sages of the generation are, whose aim is to intellect and to know Him — as He promised in saying: וְשָׁכַנְתִּי בְּתוֹכָם כְּכֹל אֲשֶׁר אֲנִי מַרְאֶה אוֹתָךְ (Exodus 25:8–9). And He further said: וְכֵן תַּעֲשׂוּ (Exodus 25:9) — as the Sages of blessed memory testified happened to them when they were expounding the Account of the Chariot, as they said of blessed memory (Hagigah 14b): אַתָּה דּוֹרֵשׁ בְּמַעֲשֵׂה מֶרְכָּבָה וּשְׁכִינָה עִמָּנוּ, וּמַלְאֲכֵי הַשָּׁרֵת מְלַוִּים אוֹתָנוּ."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "Reading הַשְׂכֵּל as 'to intellect' (verb), reflecting Sforno's technical use of שכל as both noun and verbal idea; the verse citation 'ושכנתי בתוכם ככל אשר אני מראה אותך' spans Exod. 25:8–9 as Sforno quotes it."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:27:16.323363785Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}